{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-ctf-auto",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "CTF 自动解题编排器：题面/附件 → 每题目独立工作区 → 子代理自主解题（多轮尝试、事实链、卡点登记）→ flag 本地验证与台账；设置页「CTF 自动解题」面板（题板/进度/启停/日志）。平台自动取题与自动提交本版未启用，仅预留 adapter 契约。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "ctf",
    "auto-solver",
    "agent-orchestration"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/",
    "locale/",
    "docs/",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "DESIGN.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ]
    }
  }
}
